            { ask: A('curious', 'Last question! Think about what happened in 2018.'), ok: A('cheer', 'Exactly! A huge dust storm covered the region, and communications were interrupted.'), no: A('encourage', 'It was a dust storm in June 2018. The last communication with Earth took place on the 10th of that month.') }
